  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;The proposed development, by reason of its size, scale, bulk, massing and detailed design, would result in an obtrusive, unsympathetic and incompatible form of development that fails to be subordinate to the host dwelling and fails to be in keeping with the character of this part of the terrace.&amp;nbsp; As such, the proposal is contrary to policies D3 (Optimising site capacity through the design-led approach), D4 (Delivering good design) of the London Plan (2021), policies LP1 (Design Quality and Local Character), and LP17 (Housing Design Standards) of the Hackney Local Plan 2033 (2020) and the advice in Hackney&#x27;s Resi&lt;/span&gt;dential Extensions and Alterations SPD (2025).&lt;/p&gt;"
  ]
